            "review_title": "Review at The Gioi Oc - 5KU Station - Hoang Sa",
            "review_text": "Bach H\n3 contributions\n1\nNice river view and good food\nOct 2016 • Friends\nVariety of food, reasonable price. The location is very close to the famous Chinese Ngoc Hoang pagoda and easy to be found as it is nearby the Nhieu Loc river.\nThe service is good enough for an open restaurant. The most interesting point is the open kitchen which let us see how they prepare the food (which only available in 5* restaurant). Beer is fine (they have all local and international beers) as we can drink beer anywhere but with nice view to the river and good food I think this is ideal place to comeback sometimes with friends!\nRead more\nWritten November 7, 2016",
